{"ref":"BDB, נֵכָר","hw":"נֵכָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֵכָר</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>that which is foreign, foreignness (</strong>on format. cf. Lag<sup>BN 51, 154</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:16\" href=\"/Judges.10.16\">Ju 10:16</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵכַר־</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.16\">Dt 31:16</a>;—<em>foreignness</em> (of another family, tribe, or nation), especially<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֹהֵי (הַ)נֵּכָר</span> = <em>foreign gods</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:2\" href=\"/Genesis.35.2\">Gn 35:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:4\" href=\"/Genesis.35.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:20\" href=\"/Joshua.24.20\">Jos 24:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:23\" href=\"/Joshua.24.23\">23</a> (all E, = <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אֲחֵרִים</span> of D, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַחֵר\" href=\"/BDB,_אַחֵר\", dir=\"rtl\">אַחֵר</a>), <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:16\" href=\"/Judges.10.16\">Ju 10:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.3\">1 S 7:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.19\">Je 5:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.15\">2 Ch 33:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ נֵכַר־הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.16\">Dt 31:16</a> = <em>foreign gods of the land;</em> sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל נֵכָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.12\">Dt 32:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:11\" href=\"/Malachi.2.11\">Mal 2:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:10\" href=\"/Psalms.81.10\">ψ 81:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלוֹהַּ נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:39\" href=\"/Daniel.11.39\">Dn 11:39</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־(הַ)נֵּכָר</span> = <em>foreigner</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:12\" href=\"/Genesis.17.12\">Gn 17:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא מִזַּרְעֲךָ</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:27\" href=\"/Genesis.17.27\">27</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:43\" href=\"/Exodus.12.43\">Ex 12:43</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.25\">Lv 22:25</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.9\">Ez 44:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.2\">Ne 9:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.3\">Is 56:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי (ה)נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:45\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.45\">2 S 22:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:46\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.46\">46</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:45\" href=\"/Psalms.18.45\">ψ 18:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:46\" href=\"/Psalms.18.46\">46</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.7\">Ez 44:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.6\">Is 56:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.10\">60:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.5\">61:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.8\">62:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:7\" href=\"/Psalms.144.7\">ψ 144:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:11\" href=\"/Psalms.144.11\">11</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  other combin.: <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבְלֵי נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.19\">Je 8:19</a> <em>foreign vanities</em> (idolatries); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְבְּחוֹת הַנּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.2\">2 Ch 14:2</a> <em>foreign altars;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדְמַת נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:4\" href=\"/Psalms.137.4\">ψ 137:4</a> <em>foreign soil;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכָּל־נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.30\">Ne 13:30</a> <em>from everything foreign</em>.","next":"BDB, נָכְרִי","prev":"BDB, נֶ֫כֶר"}